    "title": "Blue Yonder Workforce",
    "description": "Blue Yonder Workforce is a new mobile offering intended to provide Employee Self Service (ESS) Desktop parity and includes:\r\n\r\n* Schedule\r\n* Shift Offer\r\n* Swap Shift\r\n* Time Off\r\n* Available Shifts\r\n* My Availability\r\n* Edited Punches\r\n* Unpaired Punches\r\n* Pay Summary\r\n* Profile\r\n\r\nNote: Must hold a Blue Yonder enterprise license in order to use the application.\r\n\r\nIf the app is struck on infinite loader screen, follow below steps to resolve the issue:\r\n1. Go to Settings\r\n2. Tap on Apps\r\n3. Select All tab (if your mobile doesn't show all apps by default)\r\n4. Choose BY WFM\r\n5. Tap Clear Data\r\n6. Launch the BY WFM app again",
    "descriptionHTML": "Blue Yonder Workforce is a new mobile offering intended to provide Employee Self Service (ESS) Desktop parity and includes:<br><br>* Schedule<br>* Shift Offer<br>* Swap Shift<br>* Time Off<br>* Available Shifts<br>* My Availability<br>* Edited Punches<br>* Unpaired Punches<br>* Pay Summary<br>* Profile<br><br>Note: Must hold a Blue Yonder enterprise license in order to use the application.<br><br>If the app is struck on infinite loader screen, follow below steps to resolve the issue:<br>1. Go to Settings<br>2. Tap on Apps<br>3. Select All tab (if your mobile doesn&#39;t show all apps by default)<br>4. Choose BY WFM<br>5. Tap Clear Data<br>6. Launch the BY WFM app again",
    "summary": "BY Workforce provides real time access to Schedules and Time Off Requests.",
